:: Kill the young prince since he is the male succession. {"position":"1325,1300","size":"100,100"}
You sneak close to the young prince, 
you knew it is gonna be hard, killing a children?
Am I a real knight?

At the moment of your hesitation, he suddently open his eyes and take out a small knife that he hid under his sheet. He jumps toward you.

"I knew it! Father told me. Die, you son of a whore!"

You never expect that, he stabs into your left eyes and get onto your neck and try to stab it as well. You struggle hard to get rid of him. Suddenly you are tripped and fell behind, so is him on your back. You fall right onto the book shelf, so the shelf collapsed, you are quick to get out. But the prince is not that lucky.

He died tragically.

The sounds of your fight woke up the Queen and Gwyneth. They are shocked and can not believe their eyes. Tears start rolling down.

"OMG..."

You take out your sword, threatening them to keep it quite to not alarm the guards.

"I need you to do something for me. The Old King, he has to die. I am sorry for what happend to your son. But I am doing it for the people. They are suffering."

You originally assumed they will fight back. But Gwyneth speaks up with tears still in his eyes, with a shaking voice, "what do you want..."

Let's go to the King's room.

[[Go to the King's bedroom - with Gwyneth and the Queen and Valerian died]] 


